&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; in customer-facing technical roles (CSE, TAM, Solutions Architect, or DevOps/Security Engineer).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with &lt;strong&gt;enterprise cloud environments&lt;/strong&gt; (AWS, Azure, GCP).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
