&lt;li&gt;Resilience and persistence in the face of challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to learn and adapt to new processes and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive and curious.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
