&lt;li&gt;Own the vision, strategy, and roadmap for Orca’s ASM, Exposure Management, and Attack Paths products - including continuous discovery and inventory across external and cloud attack surface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive attack path analysis that connects exposure → lateral movement → crown-jewel impact, with “break-the-path” remediation guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the API Security strategy - API discovery and inventory/ownership, auth posture (authn/authz), sensitive exposure signals, and risk prevention/detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and track success metrics: coverage, precision, adoption, time-to-triage/remediate, and measurable risk reduction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize key initiatives across detection accuracy, automation, integrations, and enterprise readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
