&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional execution with engineering (UK), security research and analyst, sales engineering, customer success, design, and marketing teams - to deliver best-in-class features on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical and regulatory requirements into clear product specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on go-to-market strategies, enablement materials, and field feedback loops to drive awareness and adoption of Attack Surface Management offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Market Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
